title: Double Glazing
text: There is no red glass and no green glass in the box. Two panes together can still do it.
trick: stacked filters: yellow then cyan leaves green, yellow then magenta leaves red; with one yellow pane it must go before the split
motif: open field
expect: recolours>=3
